#. translators: Explanation under the "Plugins Status" heading on the Status screen.
#: inc/template-classes/status/class-wcml-status-status-ui.php:37
msgid "WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce depends on several plugins to work. If any required plugin is missing, you should install and activate it."
msgstr "WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce is afhankelijk van verschillende plugins om te werken. Als er een vereiste plugin ontbreekt, dient u deze te installeren en te activeren."

#. translators: Heading of the block on the Status screen about the cart, checkout and other WooCommerce pages.
#: inc/template-classes/status/class-wcml-status-store-pages-ui.php:39
msgid "WooCommerce Store Pages"
msgstr "WooCommerce-winkelpagina's"

#. translators: Explanation under the "WooCommerce Store Pages" heading; "this menu" is the block itself.
#: inc/template-classes/status/class-wcml-status-store-pages-ui.php:41
msgid "To run a multilingual e-commerce site, you need to have the WooCommerce shop pages translated to all the site's languages. Once all the pages are installed you can add the translations for them from this menu."
msgstr "Om een meertalige e-commerce site te beheren, moeten de WooCommerce-winkelpagina's vertaald zijn naar alle talen van de site. Zodra alle pagina's zijn geïnstalleerd, kunt u via dit menu de vertalingen ervoor toevoegen."

#. translators: Warning on the Status screen when a WooCommerce page is missing in the original language.
#: inc/template-classes/status/class-wcml-status-store-pages-ui.php:43
msgid "One or more WooCommerce pages have not been created."
msgstr "Een of meer WooCommerce-pagina's zijn niet aangemaakt."

#. translators: Button on the Status screen that creates the missing WooCommerce pages. Verb phrase, imperative.
#: inc/template-classes/status/class-wcml-status-store-pages-ui.php:45
msgid "Install WooCommerce Pages"
msgstr "WooCommerce-pagina's installeren"

#. translators: Warning on the Status screen; the list of languages follows the colon.
#: inc/template-classes/status/class-wcml-status-store-pages-ui.php:47
